@@ -765,12 +778,15 @@ Usage: grokhunter git-identity [show|set|help]
 set sources (first match wins):
   --name NAME --email EMAIL
   GROKHUNTER_GIT_NAME / GROKHUNTER_GIT_EMAIL
-  gh api user  →  display name + ID+login@users.noreply.github.com
+  gh api user
+  GH_TOKEN / GITHUB_TOKEN → api.github.com/user
+  origin github.com/OWNER → public /users/OWNER
 
   --local    Write repo-local config instead of --global
 
