+Kali/Termux often default to root <root@localhost.localdomain>
+(or an empty ident that becomes kali@localhost). GitHub cannot map
+those addresses and shows invalid-email-address.
 Use the GitHub noreply from https://github.com/settings/emails :
   git config --global user.email 'ID+LOGIN@users.noreply.github.com'
 EOF
